00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.240
apart from the anionic surfactant&nbsp;
we have some other ingredients

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.440
water is the first ingredient&nbsp;
and that's pretty important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:31.600
it keeps the surfactants spread out the right&nbsp;
way when you put them on your hair or skin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:37.280
if it's too concentrated it's really harsh you&nbsp;
