00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:12.480
there are chelating agents which grab onto metal&nbsp;
ions metal ions can make anionic surfactants work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:17.920
worse especially when there's hard water chelating&nbsp;
agents also help preservatives work better

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.400
like i said this is a relatively simple formula&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:23.360
so in other shampoos you'll&nbsp;
have other ingredients too

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:27.360
you might have other surfactants because&nbsp;
